<sp who="#GON"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Der Prinz.</hi></speaker> <p>Nichts ver&#x017F;chworen, Marinelli!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#MAR"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Marinelli.</hi></speaker> <p>Ja? Jn der That, Prinz?<lb/>
