<sp who="#MAR"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Marinelli.</hi></speaker> <p>Es i&#x017F;t eine gewi&#x017F;&#x017F;e Emilia Galotti</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#GON"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Der Prinz.</hi></speaker> <p>Wie, Marinelli? eine gewi&#x017F;&#x017F;e &#x2014;</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#MAR"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Marinelli.</hi></speaker> <p>Emilia Galotti.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#GON"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Der Prinz.</hi></speaker> <p>Emilia Galotti? &#x2014; Nim-<lb/>
