<sp who="#MAR"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Marinelli.</hi></speaker> <p>Eben die.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#GON"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Der Prinz.</hi></speaker> <p>Unfern der Kirche Allerhei-<lb/>
