<sp who="#MAR"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Marinelli.</hi></speaker> <p>Wenn Sie &#x017F;o befehlen &#x2014;</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#GON"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Der Prinz.</hi></speaker> <p>Woran &#x017F;on&#x017F;t? &#x2014; Jch will Rede!</p></sp><lb/>
