<sp who="#MAR"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Marinelli.</hi></speaker> <p>Ein &#x017F;onderbarer Zufall!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#ORS"><speaker><hi rendition="#fr">Or&#x017F;ina.</hi></speaker> <p>Zufall? &#x2014; Sie ho&#x0364;ren ja, daß es<lb/>
